            "sha256": "809757ca2bdef7b43e9f039df0c5277a4c347c1a95489097efa54695c7c1e91d",
            "status": "indexed"
          },
          "excerpt": "E-07 Transaction list access frequency\n\nClarification: the limit of four transaction list reads per calendar day without PSU\ninvolvement is counted per consent only, not per account.",
